          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On July 5, 2013, at 10:20 PM, several people were intrigued by the silent movements of 9 orange lights arranged in a diamond shape in the sky. The night flights of the French Patrol (Patrouille de France) regularly result in several witness reports. The official confirmation from the Patrouille de France (see the investigation document) allows us to classify this case of observation of a night flight by the P.A.F. (Patrouille de France) as A, perfectly identified.",
